Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没关系{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's okay.{\r}
