Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们分手了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You broke up?{\r}
