Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}马克跟我谈过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Mark and I talked...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我了解到我多爱你的笨哥哥{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and I realized how much I love your stupid brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们是有一些问题  我真的想解决{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We got our problems, but I really wanna make it work.{\r}
