Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨  是我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我整晚都在找你  我真的好难过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've been trying to reach you all night. I feel awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}求求你  罗斯  你得知道  我跟马克没什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Please, Ross, you've got to know, there's nothing between me and Mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}分手这件事太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This whole breakup thing is just stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉我让你受苦了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ugh, I'm sorry I put you through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不想用答录机跟你合好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I don't want to get back together over a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我爱你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我爱你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道吗  我要睡了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And you know what? I'm gonna go to bed now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不过明天我去上班的时候  八点半会顺道去你家  再见{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but on my way to work tomorrow, I'll stop by around 8:30. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}可洛  你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chloe, how's it coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你觉得我该养哪种狗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What kind of puppy do you think I should get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道  买只大狗怎么样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, oh, hey. I don't know. How about a big one?{\r}
