Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你得走了  等一下  我的鞋子在哪里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We have to go. Wait! Where's my shoes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你需要鞋子吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You need shoes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么我们要这么赶  还记得我跟你说的女朋友吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Do I know why we're rushing?  You know my girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她想跟我复合{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It turns out that she, uh, wants to get back together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我找到了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I found it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我为你们感到高兴  你一定很开心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's so great for you guys! You must be so happy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  那是我现在的感触之一{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, I am. One of the many things I'm feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}祝你跟你女朋友一切顺利   谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Good luck with your girlfriend. Oh, thank you. Ah, eh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你听到我的留言了吗   你还真是准时{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You got my message? You are right on time!{\r}
